99
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:08,000
So a stronger model is a better probabilistic filter, not a guarantee.

100
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:15,000
If a control lives only in the model, treat it as one layer, never the whole defense. Let's recap.

101
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Prompt injection is untrusted input the model obeys as instructions.

102
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:24,000
Direct from the user, or indirect from third-party content.

103
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
The fix is architectural.

104
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Isolate untrusted content.

105
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Cap the damage with least privilege.

106
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Keep in mind, temperature and a bigger model don't fix the problem.

107
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:38,000
That covers defending against prompt injection.

